iption and translation of speech, which suffers from an absence of sufficient parallel data resources. We...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/joint-speech-transcription","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:np8df7s4iic7cduafy6qfvzs","title":"AutoFocusFormer: Image Segmentation off the Grid","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/autofocusformer","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/autofocusformer"],"alternate_titles":["AutoFocusFormer: Image Segmentation off the Grid"],"published":"2023-05-12","authors":["Chen Ziwen","Kaushik Patnaik","Shuangfei Zhai","Alvin Wan","Zhile Ren","Alex Schwing","Alex Colburn","Li Fuxin"],"abstract":"Real world images often have highly imbalanced content density. Some areas are very uniform, e.g., large patches of blue sky, while other areas are scattered with many small objects. Yet, the commonly used successive grid downsampling strategy in convolutional deep networks treats all areas equally. Hence, small objects are represented in very few spa